  "summary": "JSON:API of dog breeds with traits, lifespan, weight and origin, plus breed groups and dog facts.",
  "description": "A free REST API serving 283 dog breeds with structured attributes (life expectancy range, male and female weight, hypoallergenic flag, origin, coat), plus breed groups and random dog facts. Responses follow the JSON:API format with pagination metadata. Useful for demos, tool-use tests and pet apps.",
